# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Large raw and processed files — use Git LFS or external storage
# ----------------------------------------------------------------
# These are listed as documentation of the LFS strategy.
# If Git LFS is configured, REMOVE these lines and add them to
# .gitattributes with:  *.geojson filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
#
# Railway_Network_.geojson          (~88 MB)
# railways-master/schedules.json    (~78 MB)
# processed_data/cleaned_schedules.csv (~62 MB)
# railways-master/trains.json       (~14 MB)
# processed_data/cleaned_trains.csv (~13 MB)
# Railway_Network_.csv              (~13 MB)
#
# NOTE: These files are NOT ignored by default so they remain
# accessible in the working directory.
# Add them to .gitattributes for LFS when LFS is enabled.
# ----------------------------------------------------------------

